<title>CHILE: Exxon Chile copper pit unaffected by quake.</title>
<headline>Exxon Chile copper pit unaffected by quake.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Mineral's Chilean copper mine Los Bronces has not been affected by a powerful earthquake which rocked capital Santiago on Monday, said an official.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no impact. Everything is working as normal,&quot; a company official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The quake, which measured 5.3 on the Richter scale, caused power cuts and panic among Santiago residents but no serious damage or injuries.</p>
<p>Los Bronces lies in the Andes close to Santiago.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
